  #place(top + left, dx: 72.0pt, dy: 72.35986328125pt)[#text(size: 11.0pt)[Sapan-wood was exceedingly plentiful throughout the forested hills, cut into logs and exported ]]
  #place(top + left, dx: 72.0pt, dy: 86.90576171875pt)[#text(size: 11.0pt)[in enormous quantities for use as kindling and red dye. In local marketplaces, transactions were ]]
